 female, from one voice identity to another). Not to be confused with a change in emotional expression by same speaker.",applicability:"synthetic",evidenceKind:"span",requiresLocalizedEvidence:!0,v0:!0,localizationMetric:"span_iou"},{id:"background_object",label:"Background Object",short:"Bg Object",aliases:["background object","bg object","bgobject","background-object"],shortcut:"g",definition:"Any background object (ie baby crying, car horn, furniture moving, dog, etc.). Not to be confused with consistent background noise.",applicability:"both",evidenceKind:"event_or_span",requiresLocalizedEvidence:!0,v0:!0,localizationMetric:"event_f1_1s"},{id:"overpresent_breathing",label:"Overpresent / Repetitive Breathing Cadence",short:"Breathing",aliases:["breathing","breathing cadence","overpresent breathing","repetitive breathing","breaths","breathing-cadence"],shortcut:"e",definition:"Overly frequent heavy breathing. Not to be confused with naturally-paced breathing (no error) or metallic breathing (warble/alias/smearing error).",applicability:"both",evidenceKind:"event_or_span",requiresLocalizedEvidence:!0,v0:!0,localizationMetric:"event_f1_1s"}],n=["Minor","Moderate","Major","Catastrophic"],a=e=>e.trim().toLowerCase(),s=new Map;for(let e of r)for(let t of[e.id,e.label,e.short,...e.aliases])s.set(a(t),e);function i(e){if(e)return s.get(a(e))}let o=[{key:"low_pesq",weight:.5,label:"Low PESQ",description:"Bad by SQUIM PESQ (< 2.8) — degraded / artifact-prone audio (subsumes the old bad-tail + borderline).",spec:{maxPesq:2.8}},{key:"high_aes_pc",weight:.5,label:"High AES-PC",description:"Bad by AES production complexity (≥ 1.65) — the conservative 'catastrophic' threshold from the AQ taxonomy-v2 calibration (P=73.7%, FP rate 2.4% on the 323-sample mono golden set): severe artifacts read as extra voices, raising production complexity. High-precision to avoid dinging high-prosody samples.",spec:{minAesPc:1.65}},{key:"very_clean",weight:.5,label:"Very Clean",description:"Prist